      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPAIN (6) returns from a short break after sitting on the speed for a game second over 1400m in the G3 SA Sires' Produce Stakes at Morphettville Parks on July 18. Fitted with the two Randwick trials and should get the Maiden win out of the way. IN CIRCLES (5) has impressed in all four career starts and should relish the extra trip today. Jumped in distance with a plugging third over 1250m at Beaumont (Newcastle). Has genuine top four prospects. PEOPLE'S CHOICE (9) Dundeel filly out of Garden Of Swans on debut for the O'Shea & Charlton yard. Hardly set the world alight in the two trials and look for a better effort under race conditions.  AUSBRED ECLIPSE (1) returns from a lengthy break. Showed ability in the first prep and returns with the two trials. Maps well and place claims look best.",
